The '''Arena de Dunas''' ("[[W:Dune|Dunes]] Arena") is a [[W:Mass timber|mass timber]] [[W:Soccer-specific stadium|football stadium]] in [[Jatiel]], [[Balisca]]. It has a capacity of 55,000 spectators, and was designed by sports architect [[Eulàlia Marquès]] of [[Rinaldi]].

